/**
 * @file architecture.dox
 * @author Alexandru ALEXANDRESCU
 * @brief System Architecture Documentation
 * 
 * @page ProjectConfigurationPage Project Configuration
 * @brief Build and configuration instructions
 *
 * ## Overview
 *
 * The library uses only fixed size containers to enforce deterministic behavior.<br>
 * Thus, there are some limits that are imposed at build time on the maximum number of services, events, maximum accepted file size, etc.<br>
 * These limits are modifiable and each modification **must** be followed by a **recompilation**.<br>
 *
 * ## Configuration
 *
 * These limits and the test options are found in the `cmake/project_config.cmake` script.<br>
 * They are used to fill the `include/core/Config.hpp.in` file and to generate the Config.hpp header at **compile-time**.
 *
 */
 